title: "Continuous AI Quality Engineering: Integrating LLM, RAG and Agent Evaluation into CI/CD Quality Gates"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Manohar
    given-names: Ashok Kumar
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-05
url: "https://github.com/ashokmanohar-ai/continuous-quality-engineering/blob/main/WHITEPAPER.md"
