  - Quality Gates
  - Generative AI
  - Regression Testing
abstract: >-
  A practical framework for integrating LLM, RAG and AI-agent evaluation into
  CI/CD quality gates alongside conventional software testing, using versioned
  datasets, deterministic checks, baseline comparison, risk-based profiles,
  retained evidence, observability and explicit release policies.
